	(text "Note: propagation delay at the MIDI OUT tip is dominated by\nQ103 storage time (about 2.0 us on rising edges vs 0.27 us on\nfalling edges). Low pulses are widened by about 5.5% UI at\n31.25 kbaud; high pulses are shortened by the same amount."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
